<title>UK: German inland gas oil rises, demand strong.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil rises, demand strong.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5569)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     38.30/38.60     24.60/24.79     38.10/38.30</p>
<p> BREMEN		38.30/38.60     24.60/24.79     38.10/38.30</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    38.40/38.70     24.66/24.86     38.00/38.20</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   39.00/39.40     25.05/25.30     38.70/38.90</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   39.20/39.50     25.17/25.37     38.80/39.00</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  40.00/40.30     25.69/25.88     39.60/39.80</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices strengthened on Monday after continuing cold weather pushed up futures and heating oil barge premiums. Sales volume was steady at around the higher levels achieved on Friday. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
